Z||000000||fierospeeder||02-16-2001||10:42 PM||||So i just got done picking my G/F off from work at 8pm.  We are heading towards my house and going to eat our subway sandwiches (this is to promote their food and get you hungry).<P>So there is a redlight and i look left and right with my signal on and i turn right.<BR>There is traffic and we wait till it starts to move.  Before that A freaking SUV with its lights on and i mean BLUE AND RED LIGHTS is behind me.  and im like S8ttt and i know i didn't do anything.  So he pulls me over, and i guess they do it in the worst places in the middle of the street in the slow lane.  We ask him what i did and he says you took a turn on a red light.  I said doesn't the sign say no turn on red when pedestrians are present.  He says No thats only on the North and South side of the street.  He says do you know of the new tickets and im like i guess so i have gotten a speeding ticket before.  He says well i can show you when i come back.<P>So i got another ticket and the last one has been about 7 months ago for speeding.  This is for only for turning right on a red and he was watching from the wendy's parking lot that use to be there.  I think its bogus.  I guess i have to go to traffic school, and atleast its only 95 bucks instead of the 115 that speeding usually is for me.  Im not sure if im on probation still.  So i hope its only a 4 hour traffic school.  I sort of want to fight it, but how can i plea guilty on something like this besides saying its dark outside and i didn't see the sign?  <BR>There goes my part time job money, &lt;tear&gt; and money for my cars.  Sucks.||||reg||1
Z||000001||My7Fieros||02-16-2001||10:59 PM||||Ummm...this getting a ticket thing seems to be contagious on this forum recently...sorry to hear that dude.<BR>I rarely write tickets...I know how it feels. Unless the violator is a complete a$$, then the pin hits the paper baby! ||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierospeeder||02-16-2001||11:23 PM||||By the way, i forgot to add this.  After i get my ticket.  I drive 1/4 of a block down to the red light.  While a car goes through the red light and the SUV cop and his sidekick is still parked about 30 feet behind me.  And didn't do anything to that car going through the red light.  No the light didn't turn red a moment ago.  It was red for a minute.  My girlfriends like, ya this cops bogus, he had to see that.||||reg||1
